# numbers and email addresses, GST and PAN registration numbers for 691 suppliers,
# and bank account details - none of it ours to publish. The scripts under
# backend/scripts read them from this directory; keeping them on disk and out of the
# index is the point. Removing them here does NOT remove them from the commits that
# already carry them - see docs/REVIEW.md.
